ext":"is"},{"key":"D","text":"have"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"I 后面用 have。","verify":"\"have\""},{"id":"cne_p068_q4","topicId":"cne_p068","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"He has glasses. 这句的意思是？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"他有眼镜"},{"key":"B","text":"他没有眼镜"},{"key":"C","text":"他是眼镜"},{"key":"D","text":"眼镜有他"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"has glasses 是有眼镜。","verify":"\"他有眼镜\""},{"id":"cne_p069_q1","topicId":"cne_p069","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"介绍一个强壮的朋友，应说哪一句？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"He is quiet."},{"key":"B","text":"He is friendly."},{"key":"C","text":"He is strong."},{"key":"D","text":"He is tall."}],"answer":"C","explanation":"强壮是 strong。","verify":"\"He is strong.\""},{"id":"cne_p069_q2","topicId":"cne_p069","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"She is friendly. 她怎么样？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"很安静"},{"key":"B","text":"很强壮"},{"key":"C","text":"很矮"},{"key":"D","text":"很友好"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"friendly 是友好的。","verify":"\"很友好\""},{"id":"cne_p069_q3","topicId":"cne_p069","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"What is his name? 这句是在问什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"他叫什么名字"},{"key":"B","text":"他在哪里"},{"key":"C","text":"他有什么"},{"key":"D","text":"他来自哪里"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"What is his name 问名字。","verify":"\"他叫什么名字\""},{"id":"cne_p069_q4","topicId":"cne_p069","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"My friend is quiet. 哪一句和这句话意思相同？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"我的朋友很强壮。"},{"key":"B","text":"我的朋友很安静。"},{"key":"C","text":"我的朋友很友好。"},{"key":"D","text":"我的朋友很高。"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"quiet 是安静的。","verify":"\"我的朋友很安静。\""},{"id":"cne_p070_q1","topicId":"cne_p070","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：I have a friend. He is strong. His name is John. 朋友叫什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Mike"},{"key":"B","text":"Amy"},{"key":"C","text":"Sarah"},{"key":"D","text":"John"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"His name is John。","verify":"\"John\""},{"id":"cne_p070_q2","topicId":"cne_p070","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：She is quiet and friendly. 哪一句和短文一致？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"她安静而且友好。"},{"key":"B","text":"她强壮而且高。"},{"key":"C","text":"她不友好。"},{"key":"D","text":"他很安静。"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"quiet and friendly，主语是 She。","verify":"\"她安静而且友好。\""},{"id":"cne_p070_q3","topicId":"cne_p070","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：He has a blue bag. 他有什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"一个红色的包"},{"key":"B","text":"一个蓝色的包"},{"key":"C","text":"一副眼镜"},{"key":"D","text":"一把尺子"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"a blue bag。","verify":"\"一个蓝色的包\""},{"id":"cne_p070_q4","topicId":"cne_p070","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：My friend is Amy. She has long hair. 谁留着长头发？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"John"},{"key":"B","text":"Mike"},{"key":"C","text":"Amy"},{"key":"D","text":"Chen Jie"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"Amy 是朋友，She has long hair。","verify":"\"Amy\""},{"id":"cne_p212_q1","topicId":"cne_p212","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"哪个单词的意思是「友好善良的」？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"kind"},{"key":"B","text":"funny"},{"key":"C","text":"tall"},{"key":"D","text":"quiet"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"kind 是善良友好的。","verify":"\"kind\""},{"id":"cne_p212_q2","topicId":"cne_p212","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"helpful 的意思是？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"有趣的"},{"key":"B","text":"诚实的"},{"key":"C","text":"安静的"},{"key":"D","text":"乐于助人的"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"helpful 是乐于助人。","verify":"\"乐于助人的\""},{"id":"cne_p212_q3","topicId":"cne_p212","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"「有趣的」用哪个词？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"honest"},{"key":"B","text":"helpful"},{"key":"C","text":"funny"},{"key":"D","text":"kind"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"funny 是有趣的。","verify":"\"funny\""},{"id":"cne_p212_q4","topicId":"cne_p212","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"He is honest. 他怎么样？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"安静"},{"key":"B","text":"诚实"},{"key":"C","text":"有趣"},{"key":"D","text":"强壮"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"honest 是诚实。","verify":"\"诚实\""},{"id":"cne_p213_q1","topicId":"cne_p213","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"想说「她乐于助人」，应选哪一句？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"She is helpful."},{"key":"B","text":"She is help."},{"key":"C","text":"She helpful is."},{"key":"D","text":"She are helpful."}],"answer":"A","explanation":"She is + 形容词。","verify":"\"She is helpful.\""},{"id":"cne_p213_q2","topicId":"cne_p213","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"I choose him because he is kind. 我选他的原因是？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"他很高"},{"key":"B","text":"他很安静"},{"key":"C","text":"他有眼镜"},{"key":"D","text":"他善良"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"because he is kind。","verify":"\"他善良\""},{"id":"cne_p213_q3","topicId":"cne_p213","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一句适合写进朋友小书？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"My friend are funny."},{"key":"B","text":"Friend my is kind."},{"key":"C","text":"My friend is funny and kind."},{"key":"D","text":"My friend is a book."}],"answer":"C","explanation":"用 is 连接品质词。","verify":"\"My friend is funny and kind.\""},{"id":"cne_p213_q4","topicId":"cne_p213","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"She is honest and helpful. 哪一句意思相同？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"他诚实。"},{"key":"B","text":"她诚实而且乐于助人。"},{"key":"C","text":"她有趣而且安静。"},{"key":"D","text":"她强壮而且高。"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"honest and helpful，主语 She。","verify":"\"她诚实而且乐于助人。\""}]
